## Where the rules actually live

| What | Where | Loads when |
|---|---|---|
| <domain A: e.g. the data-access rules> | `<path/to/rules/domain-a.md>` | you touch <glob for domain A> |
| <domain B> | `<path/to/rules/domain-b.md>` | you touch <glob for domain B> |
| <a task procedure, start to finish> | a skill — `<path/to/skills/name>` | its description matches the request |
| <a durable lesson from a past mistake> | memory | recalled by relevance |
| <every current count, threshold, percentage> | nowhere in this file, on purpose | measure it live |

**Read those, do not recall them.** A figure copied up into this file is a figure that will be
wrong later with nothing to catch it.

